MLIR-AIE / TileFuse adaptations

The graph topology and native BF16 four-accumulator matrix kernel follow
AMD MLIR-AIE whole_array and aie_kernels/aie2p/mm.cc at
7e00b57955e108fe9d8e9419f5828a0c7e650858.

The BFP16-backed 8x8x8 MMUL strategy, original W4A16 buffer contract
and corrected per-column dequantization
follow aie_kernels/aie2p/mix_int4_ATB.cc and
programming_examples/tilefuse/gemm_w4a16/test.cpp from
https://github.com/glassescrab/mlir-aie at
121dd54abc68f84d89a7074372ebf82be2db62d5.

